  "description": "Please note: All enquiries should be made by email only.\n\nManor Properties are delighted to bring this attractive two-bedroom bungalow to the rental market.\nThis bright and spacious property is ideally located within walking distance of a wide range of local amenities and is just a minute’s walk from the beach, making it an excellent opportunity for those seeking a comfortable home in a convenient and desirable location.\n\nThe accommodation comprises:\n• Entrance hallway\n• Open-plan lounge, dining and kitchen area\n• Two bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from an en-suite bathroom\n• Main bathroom\n• Upgraded Electric storage heating throughout\n\nThe property is very well presented throughout and offers comfortable and practical living accommodation.\n\nStrictly no smoking and no pets permitted.\n\nNote: These particulars are given on the understanding that they will not be construed as part of a contract, conveyance or lease, and that all negotiations take place through Manor Properties. Whilst every care is taken in the complying of the aforementioned information, the information is not guaranteed, and enquirers must therefore satisfy themselves regarding all particulars",
